  "steps": [
    "Peel and finely chop the cucumbers, and drain off any excess water.",
    "Add the crushed peanuts, green chilli and grated coconut.",
    "Season with salt and sugar.",
    "Add the lemon juice and coriander leaves.",
    "Toss well and serve immediately so the peanuts stay crunchy."
